<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    The customs of the land and the faith (Defs/DilemmaDefs/Council_Dilemmas_Customs2.xml). Kept small, and half of them
    give something other than mood (RewardInstead): recreation in the rain, trust from the blessing of the waters, a
    long view's awe from the high watch, recreation and awe from the tree-singing.
  -->

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_SunsReturn</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the sun's return</label><description>I watched the sun come back over the ridge after the long dark. Winter's over. I felt it go.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_RainWelcome</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the rain welcome</label><description>We stood out in the rain together until we were soaked through, laughing like children.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><joy>0.15</joy><feelings><li>Joy</li></feelings><felt>3</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_WaterBlessing</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the waters blessed</label><description>The water had its loaf, and the words were said over it. It floated a long way before it sank.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><trust>1.5</trust><feelings><li>Hope</li></feelings><felt>2</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_MarshLights</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the marsh lights</label><description>Smoking torches after dark to keep the marsh off us. My eyes stung, and the insects kept their distance for once.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_HighWatch</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the high watch</label><description>From the high ground I could cover the whole colony with one hand held out. Every roof and field down there, we made.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><joy>0.08</joy><feelings><li>Awe</li><li>Pride</li></feelings><felt>3</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_NightVigil</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the night vigil</label><description>I kept the vigil through the longest night, trimming the lamp and saying the words. By first light my voice was hoarse.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_TreeSinging</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the tree-singing</label><description>We sang to the old tree, and I'd swear the leaves moved without any wind.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><joy>0.12</joy><feelings><li>Awe</li></feelings><felt>3</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_AncestorsSupper</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>supper with the dead</label><description>Their names were said before supper, one after another, and cups went up for each. For an evening they felt very near.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
